    "Review the command details, resolve the reported error, then Refresh before retrying.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review the command details, resolve the reported error, then Refresh before retrying."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看命令详情并处理所示错误，然后刷新重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "檢視指令詳細資訊並處理所示錯誤，然後重新整理並重試。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "コマンドの詳細を確認し、エラーを解決してから更新し、再試行してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "명령 세부 정보를 확인하고 오류를 해결한 후 새로 고치고 재시도하세요."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Consultez les détails, résolvez l’erreur, puis actualisez avant de réessayer."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Befehlsdetails prüfen, Fehler beheben und vor erneutem Versuch neu laden."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revisa los detalles, resuelve el error y actualiza antes de reintentar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The update check failed. Update availability is unknown. Try Check for Updates again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The update check failed. Update availability is unknown. Try Check for Updates again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新检查失败，当前是否有更新尚不明确。请再次检查更新。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新檢查失敗，目前是否有更新尚不明確。請再次檢查更新。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新確認に失敗しました。更新の有無は不明です。もう一度確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "업데이트 확인에 실패하여 업데이트 여부를 알 수 없습니다. 다시 확인하세요."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La recherche a échoué. La disponibilité des mises à jour est inconnue. Réessayez."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Updateprüfung fehlgeschlagen. Verfügbare Updates sind unbekannt. Erneut prüfen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Falló la comprobación. No se sabe si hay actualizaciones. Vuelve a comprobar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This operation needs an interactive administrator prompt. Copy the command and run it in Terminal, then return and Refresh. 1Tool does not elevate privileges.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This operation needs an interactive administrator prompt. Copy the command and run it in Terminal, then return and Refresh. 1Tool does not elevate privileges."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作需要交互式管理员提示。请复制命令并在终端运行，然后返回刷新。1Tool 不会自动提权。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作需要互動式管理員提示。請複製指令並在終端機執行，然後返回並重新整理。1Tool 不會自動提升權限。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "管理者の対話的な確認が必要です。コマンドをコピーしてターミナルで実行後、戻って更新してください。1Tool は権限を昇格しません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "대화형 관리자 확인이 필요합니다. 명령을 복사해 터미널에서 실행한 후 돌아와 새로 고치세요. 1Tool은 권한을 자동으로 높이지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une confirmation administrateur interactive est nécessaire. Copiez la commande, exécutez-la dans Terminal, puis actualisez. 1Tool n’élève pas les privilèges."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interaktive Administratorbestätigung erforderlich. Befehl kopieren, im Terminal ausführen, dann zurückkehren und neu laden. 1Tool erhöht keine Rechte."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se necesita una confirmación interactiva de administrador. Copia el comando, ejecútalo en Terminal y actualiza al volver. 1Tool no eleva privilegios."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates have not been checked. Check for Updates to see available upgrades.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Updates have not been checked. Check for Updates to see available upgrades."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未检查更新。请点击检查更新以查看可升级的包。"
